OL,3,GNEWSAMissile manufacturer amends plan
OL,4,Afor former RAF base
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company behind a proposal for a
OL,7,Fmissile motor factory at a former RAF
OL,8,Fbase has changed its plans following
OL,9,Fopposition from Historic England.
OL,11,FThe heritage organisation had objected
OL,12,Fto the #24m development at the former
OL,13,FRAF Coltishall in Norfolk because of
OL,14,Fconcerns it could cause "severe harm"
OL,15,Fto the Cold War site.
OL,17,FBut defence manufacturer Cambridge
OL,18,FAerospace has amended its plan to put
OL,19,Fstorage units near blast-doors on the
OL,20,Fformer base, and Historic England said
OL,21,Fit had withdrawn its objection.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
