OL,3,GNEWSAMissile manufacturer amends plan
OL,4,Afor former RAF base
OL,5,
OL,6,FCambridge Aerospace said it welcomed
OL,7,Fthe decision and its plans "will bring
OL,8,Fsignificant investment and highly
OL,9,Fskilled jobs to North Norfolk".
